Stop reprinting Importing: 100% for the rest of an import

inflateInterrupter divides by a hard-coded per-arch expectedTotalAccess
estimate, so once the real access count overshoots it the ratio pins at 1.0
and the throttle's percent == 100 clause re-fires on every step, printing a
few thousand identical lines. Requiring lastPrintedPercent < 100 keeps the
intended final 100% line and caps a whole import at 21 lines.
